<title>italy: CYCLING-ITALY'S BARONTI WINS THE 15TH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S BARONTI WINS THE 15TH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>BORGOMANERO, Italy 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alessandro Baronti of Italy won the 173-km 15th stage of the Giro d'Italia on Sunday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Filippo Casagrande of Italy was second and his compatriot Paolo Salvoldelli third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Italian Ivan Gotti retained the overall lead.</p>
